WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.120
Tell me whatever you like, Igarashi!

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.620
Don't hold back, no matter what it is!

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.040
What are you getting so sparkly-eyed about?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.250
Is there something amusing about this?

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.290
No, no!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.200
I mean, this is pretty rare, right?

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:30.330
I'm happy that you could lean on me.
I'm all ears, Igarashi, so speak freely!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.160
Jealous? What the heck...?

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.000
Everyone gets jealous, you know!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.830
Why don't you just say it directly?
Tell him not to talk to other girls!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.040
I-I can't say that.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:45.950
Huh?

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:57.910
I don't have any right to take
that freedom away from someone.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.620
You're so stubborn!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:06.790
It would be the first time...
telling someone that I want them to do as I say.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:11.370
Igarashi, why are you holding anything back
with that four-eyed otaku?

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:16.120
Be harsher with what you say, like a preppy girl!
You're gonna ruin your image!

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:19.450
What in the world kind of image do you think I have?

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.000
If it were me, I'd say it all.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.410
"Why were you talking with that girl?!"

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.450
"Who's more important to you, me or her?!

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:36.200
I'm sorry. I think I consulted the wrong person.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.040
Wait!

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.790
Jeez, you're inept for someone
who looks like an old-pro at this.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.160
If you're endearingly jealous about things,
Tsutsui will listen to what you say.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.330
It would be the first time telling someone
that I want them to do as I say.

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:57.910
Ichiban daijin a koto wa
The most important thing

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:02.040
Daremo shiranai koto nanda
Is something nobody knows

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:06.120
Are mo kore mo daijina you de
Things which may be considered important

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.660
Toki ga sugireba kiete yuku
May fade away as time goes by

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:17.450
Kaze ni notte kumo no kirema ni
Romance in pale pink

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:23.830
Tadayou no wa omoide no you na
Like the palm of a hand which has begun to color

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:33.200
Irozuki hajimeta te no hira no you na
Riding on the wind

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:39.870
Usubeni iro no koigokoro
Just like memories drifting in the break in the clouds

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:45.200
Toki wo kakenuke yagate kuru
The new season will come soon

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:51.160
Atarashii kisetsu yume to wa sukoshi chigau
Leaping through time

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:54.660
Tada oboeteiru koto wa
And it's little different from a dream

00:02:54.660 --> 00:03:00.580
Daijina koto nanda
But the things I remember are very important

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:06.290
Ichiban daijina kotoba
The most important words

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:10.410
Daremo iwazuni owarisou
May never be said to anybody

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:14.370
Are mo kore mo daijoubu sa
Everything will be all right

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:18.330
Toki ga sugitemo oboeteru
Even though time passes, I will remember

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:22.200
Anata no koto wa oboeteru
I will remember you

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:29.250
Episode 7
About the Two Girls and Me

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.330
Wh-what's wrong?

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.870
You called me here, so why are you quiet?

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.370
This is scary... is she mad about something?

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:41.950
Why... were you talking to that girl?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.330
"That girl"?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:48.160
With the glasses. She brought you your magazine.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.290
Oh, Ayado is-

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.620
Why?

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:56.830
Why did it look like you were enjoying time with that girl
when you told me not to come near you?

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.700
This isn't cute at all...

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.540
Huh?

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.950
I'm sorry, forget it.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.950
Hey, wait!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:15.750
I randomly see Ayado sometimes
and we have some shared interests so we talk ab-

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.750
That's enough!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.040
It's nothing!

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.790
It's not "nothing," though...

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:47.250
Oh, sorry, did I get you Ayado?

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.700
Hey, this happened cuz you're goofing off!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:53.040
It's okay! These are my gym clothes.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.450
I see. I'm really sorry, though!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.200
Ah, I'm glad it was just Ayado.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:00.200
By the way, I wonder if she thinks
gardening all the time is fun.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.620
She's a weirdo, right?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.330
Excuse me...

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.370
Huh? Th-the Girlfriend!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.450
Wh-why are you...?

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:18.660
Sorry. I saw what just happened.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.790
Thank you so much for going to the trouble!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.580
Are you okay?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.750
O-oh yes, totally! This happens all the time!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:30.500
I apologize for causing you any concern...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:36.040
But more importantly, Girlfriend-senpai,
on top of being beautiful, you're also kind!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:40.580
Seriously, you two are so wonderful,
I admire you both!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:47.160
I'm not really all that wonderful of a person.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.660
I'm sorry.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:52.500
That isn't true at all! Um, how can I thank you?

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:57.500
Don't worry about thanking me.
And you don't have to return the handkerchief either.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.660
Well, sorry for being so sudden.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.950
It's okay!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.830
Hurry and change, alright?

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:06.540
Really... thank you so much!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.700
So is this how it is now?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.330
It's just like Ishino warned me it would be...

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:22.410
Before, when I saw her walking with that doctor,
I suffered tremendous damage.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:26.580
I wonder if
I made her feel
that way too...

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:26.620
I wonder if I made her feel that way too...

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:33.830
I thought... there was no way that I would
make her feel angry or agitated as I am.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.700
What nonsense are you going on about?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.370
This is an irresponsible learning style, you know!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:43.290
If you just stay here and do that, nothing will be resolved!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.750
Let's go find Iroha right now!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.660
I've got no choice...

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.700
I'm gonna cast my secret spell!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:51.700
Huh?!

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.500
Here I go!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:56.120
Keppare PUNCH!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:57.790
What was that stick for?!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.330
Thank goodness.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.750
Err... Um...

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.700
I see... So that's what it is.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.870
Yeah. When I talked to her, I found she was a nice girl.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.700
Sorry.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.660
I-I'm glad.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.250
She was somewhat like you.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.620
I see.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:35.200
I'm sorry. Even though I was telling you
to believe me, I doubted you a bit.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.700
I've only been angry recently, haven't I?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:42.620
No, it's all been my fault!
So please, tell me anything you need to!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.870
I want to resolve things with you as quickly as possible!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.830
Can I become how I was today?

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:50.250
Yeah.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.750
It was cute.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:11.120
Wh-what is it, Ishino?!

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:16.580
You... Even though I warned you,
you made snacks for that girl again...

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.950
Oh, no! I received something from her,
so it was just a logical thing to give back!

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.910
There's not a particularly deep meaning to it!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:26.120
Shall I be the one to put some flowers
on your desk next time?

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.830
Who is that girl to you? And where's she from?!

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:33.330
Are you my mother or something?!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.410
E-excuse me!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:37.540
Huh?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.160
Senpai, you ARE a normie, aren't you?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.040
How does it look like I am?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.290
Aren't you the one Tsutsui is cheating with?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.080
Huh?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.620
What are you saying?! Absolutely not!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:51.830
That's right! There's no way
someone like me could do that!

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.500
B-beautiful!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:01.500
Why does Tsutsui-senpai
only have such beautiful people around?

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.750
Tsutsui... she's a good girl.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.700
By the way, did you need something?

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:11.080
Oh, excuse me. I brought him tomatoes
as thanks for the dumplings.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.040
Ayado.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:13.870
Huh?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.040
At this rate, we'll be making an infinite loop of gifts.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.830
Well, if it's that you have too many, I'll take them, though.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.200
I want some.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:27.120
We've already had a good harvest,
and there are no other people that I can give these to.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:29.700
Morning...

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.830
Ah, Ito.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.790
Oh, morning, shorty.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:37.080
C-cat ears!

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.540
Ito, this is-

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:39.500
Uh...

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.000
Huh?

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.750
H-he disappeared.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.080
It's because Ito is shy with strangers.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.830
You bloom beautifully, Rudbeckia.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.040
Flowers really are nice.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:59.330
Oh, there you are. Ayado!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:01.750
Come to the courtyard!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.080
Tsutsui said he made some tomato jelly.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.200
We'll be waiting!

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:20.750
Amazing... My tomatoes are happy
to have been made into something like this!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.160
I-it's not that big of a deal...

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.660
Ishino, eat this cream.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.910
Oh, sorry, I put some in there.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:30.790
It's such a loss that you're not able to eat cream.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:32.410
It's okay since I won't gain weight.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.040
You should gain a bit of weight...

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.660
I'm sorry, Cat Ear-senpai.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.450
Is it okay that I'm here?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.540
Was he like that when I was invited too?

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:52.330
The course of events
were pretty spontaneous at that time, I think.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.040
I'm sorry! I'll eat quickly and leave!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:57.870
It's okay, don't worry about it.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:58.910
No...

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:02.830
What's that?

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.120
It's an eggplant.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:05.200
Eggplant this time?!

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.700
I told you not to trouble yourself with that, though.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.660
I'm sorry, but it turns out
that I somehow had nothing to do.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:19.160
Even though I was invited to this lovely party,
since there's no way I can do one single party trick...

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:23.330
No one is asking for one,
and we don't do things like "party tricks."

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.750
We have extra, so go ahead and take another.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.750
Huh? But-

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:32.580
Ayado, you really don't have to bring anything.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:39.200
When you feel like it, or when you want to chat a little,
you can come talk to us and join in.

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:44.830
That's right. We only do
this sort of thing at random times.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:48.000
What're you doing showing such concern
for someone like Tsutsui?

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.250
Ishino, can you please show
a little more concern for me?

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:58.410
Why is it that everyone around Senpai...
is so warmhearted?

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.750
But for now, if you cry, that's a problem!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.830
Here, have a handkerchief.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:20.620
Girlfriend-senpai and Cat Ears-senpai...

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:26.660
I received handkerchiefs from the both of those people.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.250
Oh no, every time I think about that I cry.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:34.830
I used it again even though it's washed...

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:41.080
Maybe since Tsutsui-senpai is kind,
those around him are also kind.

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:43.370
Good morning.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:47.200
Tsu..Tsutsui-senpai. Good morning.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:51.200
Yesterday, you went off somewhere crying, so...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:56.370
I-I'm sorry, that was nothing!
Please don't worry about that...

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.160
I-I see.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.000
I wonder if it's better not to mention it.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.370
Stay still for a little while.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:10.950
There's something stuck to you.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:22.290
Sorry! It's a hairy caterpillar! I won't touch it!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.580
Huh? O-oh, it's alright.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:32.120
Hairy caterpillars are my friends.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.410
As expected of the gardening club...

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.830
Oh, Ayado, you'd better hurry.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:40.830
Right!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:41.910
See you later!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.750
Just his hand coming closer to my face
has my heartbeat going crazy.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:57.330
I'm embarrassed that I have no immunity to that.

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:01.620
Tsutsun.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:02.830
Yeah?

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.080
What are you doing on our day off tomorrow?

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:06.790
Tomorrow...

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.250
If you want to, tomorrow-

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.120
Tomorrow I'm going to Akihabara with Ito.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Sorry, never mind.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:17.040
Wait! Want to come with us to Akihabara?

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.290
It's okay.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.700
I don't want that.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.750
It's fine, just buy some clothes!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.000
What I have right now is enough!

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:30.500
Doesn't it embarrass you that it always
looks like you're wearing ratty pajama pants?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.450
Normal high schoolers are interested
in fashion, aren't they?

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:35.580
Don't ask me to be normal!

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:39.290
Poor Iroha-chan, having a boyfriend like this...

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.620
Th-that's undoubtedly true. I mean,
that's what I've thought for a long time now.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.620
Ah, poor Iroha... Ah, she's going to dump you...

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.330
She's going to dump you!

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.330
Th-that's undoubtedly true. I mean,
that's what I've thought for a long time now.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.120
UP your freshness
with a balance of color
Make a Cool
Silhouette

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.040
I don't get it!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.160
I don't really understand clothes either.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.370
Oh...

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:55.870
Oh, Takanashi.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:56.870
Don't talk to me.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.830
Why are you in a place like this?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.000
Hey you!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:02.700
I came here to buy a part for my computer!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.000
I am not the same as you.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:07.290
Well, whatever. By the way,
I want to ask you about something.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:10.450
Please, make me fashionable.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.040
Don't say stupid things.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.200
Hey, is that scarf-lookin' thing
for protection against the cold?

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.370
Shut up, and walk further away from me.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.620
Is... this one cool?

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:30.000
It's a decent step up. Get it.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.160
And hurry up and let me go.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:35.500
Can you tell me the meaning
of the length of these pants?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:38.830
They're like the ones I was forced to wear in junior high.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.620
It doesn't mean anything.

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:45.000
Seriously. Once again I can't understand
someone like you being Igarashi's boyfriend...

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.200
You're right.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.750
What I always wear is fine after all.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.410
It isn't fine! Give me back my time!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.950
So this is fashionable...

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.120
Why in the world am I walking around the city
with guys like this?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:02.290
Hello! A maid café has opened!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:03.160
Huh?

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:04.160
Oh!

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.870
Please come see us!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.620
Ayado?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:17.700
Senpai!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.910
What in the world are you wearing?

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.700
Ayado, are you working as a maid?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.330
No, I'm just handing out tissues as a part-time job!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.290
Sorry, I didn't have my glasses on!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:32.410
U-um, there's a figure that I want,
so I'm only doing this job temporarily.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:35.000
The difference between this and normal you is surprising.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:40.500
Just like with my cosplay hobby,
if I don't have my glasses on I'm not shy.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:45.200
Wow, it's a maid! She's cute!
Can you come with me next door?

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.580
What a nice figure!

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:50.500
I-I'm limited to passing out tissues...

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:54.290
C'mon, it's okay, you can be flexible right?

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.410
Hey, will you serve us alcohol and stuff?

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:58.160
Um, I-I'm sorry...

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.540
Wait...!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.290
Let go of her hand.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.790
Unlike cabaret girls,
it is completely forbidden to touch maids.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.950
Even though she is a maid,
at a maid café she is the same as a waitress.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.660
That physical touch is considered sexual harassment.

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:19.330
Everyone follows the rules and enjoys the maid café.
Research them well and come back some other time!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:23.450
Uh, yeah, sorry... I kinda....
got carried away and forced you.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.450
Let's go, Akiba is scary!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.910
Th-thank you.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.540
Tsutsui, what are you gonna do? Go straight home?

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:40.620
What should I do? Maybe I'll go home,
and watch that anime that I told you about the othe-

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.950
Sorry. It's really okay.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.330
Hey, Tsutsui...

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.540
I'm sorry, Ito! I have to go!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.790
Tsutsun, what's up, all of a sudden?

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:04.000
Nothing, I was just worried...

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:07.200
I'm sorry I couldn't see you today.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.120
But it's fine.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.410
It's kind of been a while since we've met in the evening.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.830
Sorry, are your parents okay with this?

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.040
Totally.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:30.120
There are times I'm making you or someone else
uncomfortable without knowing it, so...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.870
Sometimes I get uneasy.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.700
That isn't true.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.410
It's not that I'm uncomfortable,

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:38.790
it's just that since I love you,
there are more things that I want you to understand.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.080
Yeah.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:46.120
That, and since you're kind to everyone,
there are also times when I unknowingly get uneasy...

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.200
Am I... kind to everyone?

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:53.080
I think people that are kind
to everyone have more friends, though!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.250
Also...

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.700
The length of your pants is too short.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.450
This is fashion! They were chosen for me by Takanashi.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:08.580
Takanashi? Fashion... I'm sorry I didn't realize that.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.750
Oh, it's Ayado.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:16.870
Oh!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.290
It's unusual to see you at this time.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.540
I stayed up late last night!

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:26.790
Um, thank you so much for yesterday!
You really helped me out.

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:30.410
No problem. If nothing happened after that, then I'm glad.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:36.080
Bye, I have to go now!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.700
She's in a hurry, huh?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.620
Mountain stream fishing and campfires in the great outdoors.
DACHI CAMPGROUNDS
Comfortable Cottage - Spacious Kitchen - Barbecue Material Rental

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.750
Ishino, what is this?

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:48.790
It's camping.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:53.250
Your explanation is too simple! I'm asking you
what that is and why camping!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:57.250
Do you have some kind of complaint about nature,
negative ions, and meat?

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.450
What kind of coercive invitation is this?

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.750
In any case, you want to go camping, right, Ishino?

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.620
But why are you inviting us?

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:10.160
My grandfather has a vacation home here, and if
I go clean this season, I'll get some spending money.

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:13.580
LET'S GO
CAMPING!!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.790
What the hell?!

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:13.700
Aren't you just tactfully trying to use us?

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:18.580
I pass. I've never done this kind of
normie event before, so I don't wanna.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.540
This is why you get called a "hopeless guy," you know.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.250
I don't get called that!

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:26.330
You don't understand, do you, Ishino?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:31.450
I'm unwilling to feel like I have to force myself
to be excited over something like this.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.500
I'm not expecting you to be
the life of the party or anything.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.700
Invite Takanashi along.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:39.580
Wha-?!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:42.290
If you do that, then I'll be excited.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:46.200
How drenched in self-centeredness are your plans?!
I absolutely refuse.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.660
I can't just ask that guy so suddenly like that...

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:56.120
I've never been camping before,
but I think I might want to...

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.290
Huh?

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:59.950
Camping... with friends...

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:01.410
So it's decided.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.790
H-hold on, now!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.540
Does this mean I have to invite Takanashi?

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:06.330
Of course!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.120
Hurry up, let's go!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.120
Wait up!

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:19.040
I wonder if it's okay to invite that girl, too...

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:40.830
Yume ga same sora nagamete omou
I wake from a dream and gaze at the sky

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:46.160
Mune wo utsu ano kotoba kirei da
And think of those beautiful words that touched my heart

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:50.540
Uwabe kazarazu hanasetara na...
If only I could talk to you without putting on airs...

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:56.040
Sobietatsu fuan no tou ga
Is the pillar of fear towering above it all

00:21:57.410 --> 00:22:00.410
Ari no mama de ii no kana??
Okay just the way it is?

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
Nan oku kounen nayameba ii no darou??
For how many millions of light-years must I suffer??

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:08.830
Saa sugu doa akete
Come on, open the door now

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.910
Ai ni yukou
And let's meet

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:15.830
Imi nado nai yo hotondo ga
Most of it means nothing, you know

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:20.330
Kimi ni sokkou de minukareru no osorete
The fear that you immediately see through me

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:25.540
Koukai bakari da ne futari wa kitto
Fills me with regret, surely

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:30.580
Zutto miageteta sora wa sotto
The sky that we always stared up at, quietly

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:35.500
Bokura no asu wo terasu kitto
It will brighten our tomorrow, surely

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:37.620
Kimi ni aitai desu
I want to see you

00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:40.120
Sugoku kantan na koto nan jan ne
That's not a super easy thing, right?

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:42.870
Hora mijukumono
Hey, the inexperienced

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:46.620
Seishun believer desu
Are believers in youth.
